    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38024" root="لهب" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهَبَانٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهَبٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُهْبَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, The <i>burning</i>
of coals, or embers, <i>without blazing.</i> (T.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  The
<i>burning</i> of heat upon heated ground. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4- 
<i>Vehemence of heat</i> (K) upon heated ground and
the like. (ISd.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <i>A hot day.</i> (K.)

